cleaning hanging up

07:52.192 --> 07:53.592
in the backseat
of your car.

07:53.593 --> 07:55.362
- Did you win the lottery?
- No.

07:55.363 --> 07:57.932
Well, I hope you're not actually
doing that gigolo thing.

07:57.933 --> 08:00.035
You know,
prostitution is illegal.

08:00.036 --> 08:02.272
Uh, uh, no, no, no.
It's, uh, it's something else.

08:02.273 --> 08:04.059
Uh, uh, Quagmire's, uh,

08:04.060 --> 08:06.544
selling online
Internet cyber stuff.

08:06.545 --> 08:08.597
Wow. Good for you,
Quagmire.

08:09.933 --> 08:11.284
You and Gates, huh?

08:12.954 --> 08:16.207
Uh, geez, I got to go home and
change into my Tarzan costume.

08:16.208 --> 08:18.778
Uh, uh... for...
for... for the Web.

08:18.779 --> 08:21.045
Huh. I got to
get a computer.

08:26.991 --> 08:29.493
Excuse me. How many BTUs
does this grill have?

08:29.494 --> 08:30.928
Oh, man. That puppy?

08:30.929 --> 08:33.048
More than you need,
less that I want.

08:33.049 --> 08:35.468
E-Excuse me. Do you have
a small grocery cart

08:35.469 --> 08:37.951
I could put this boat-sized
hunk of lumber in?

08:37.952 --> 08:39.139
Probably out in the parking lot.

08:39.140 --> 08:40.775
Can you tell me where I
can find extension cords?

08:40.776 --> 08:42.645
- Aisle 25.
- I was just there.

08:42.646 --> 08:44.313
- 26.
- There is no 26.

08:44.314 --> 08:45.723
15.

08:46.467 --> 08:47.618
So Goby gets up
on the lift...

08:47.619 --> 08:48.753
Don't mind me.

08:48.754 --> 08:50.489
Just grabbing myself
a cup of mud.

08:50.490 --> 08:51.940
I like mine black.

08:51.941 --> 08:53.593
Black as night.

08:53.594 --> 08:55.463
Black as sin,
know what I'm saying?

08:55.464 --> 08:56.931
Haven't introduced myself.

08:56.932 --> 08:59.518
Guys in my crew
call me "The Ratchet."

08:59.519 --> 09:00.870
Brian, it's not your break.

09:00.871 --> 09:02.539
Get out there
and help the customers.

09:02.540 --> 09:04.441
Brian?
Who are you, my father?

09:04.442 --> 09:05.677
Ha! This guy.

09:05.678 --> 09:07.565
- Get out there!
- Yes, sir.

09:08.991 --> 09:11.293
That guy's got no idea
how hard I'm work...

09:11.294 --> 09:13.758
Bird! A bird got in! Awesome!

09:21.867 --> 09:23.001
Hello?

09:23.002 --> 09:24.669
Hey, Quagmire, what's going on?

09:24.670 --> 09:25.838
Oh, you need a ride?

09:25.839 --> 09:27.139
Yeah, sure. I can come get you.

09:27.140 --> 09:28.175
I'm not doing anything.

09:32.147 --> 09:33.849
Meg, that was the last guy,

09:33.850 --> 09:35.853
so just lock up
when you're done.

09:43.031 --> 09:44.097
Thanks for the ride.

09:44.098 --> 09:45.666
One of my tricks
drove me here from the Clam,

09:45.667 --> 09:47.134
and I didn't have
any money for a cab.

09:47.135 --> 09:49.104
Why not? Didn't she
just pay you for sex?

09:49.105 --> 09:51.340
No. After it was over,
she said she wasn't gonna pay.

09:51.341 --> 09:52.943
Well, that ain't fair.

09:52.944 --> 09:55.346
You can't let these women take
advantage of you like that.

09:55.347 --> 09:57.248
What apartment is she in?
I'll go talk to her.

09:57.249 --> 09:58.851
She's in unit 17.

09:58.852 --> 10:00.387
You know, if you're
going back in anyway,

10:00.388 --> 10:01.555
can you grab my belt?

10:01.556 --> 10:03.592
It's reversible,
so I'd hate to lose it.

10:07.632 --> 10:09.766
Hey, you didn't pay my friend!

10:09.767 --> 10:12.269
So I'm gonna play with
your doorbell until you pay up.

10:14.073 --> 10:15.741
Stop it!

10:15.742 --> 10:17.711
I can do this all day.
I love buttons.

10:17.712 --> 10:19.479
Fine, here's your money!

10:21.251 --> 10:22.550
Here you go.

10:22.551 --> 10:24.860
Peter, this is amazing.
Thank you.

10:24.861 --> 10:25.722
Hey, you know what?

10:25.723 --> 10:27.207
Here's a little something
for your trouble.

10:27.208 --> 10:29.092
You're giving me a cut?

10:29.093 --> 10:30.430
Wow, thanks!

10:30.431 --> 10:32.932
No problem. It's just too bad
you're not here every time.

10:32.933 --> 10:34.550
Well, I could be.

10:34.551 --> 10:36.470
I mean, my days
are pretty open,

10:36.471 --> 10:38.940
