10:38.941 --> 10:41.372
Huh. That'd be
kind of nice, actually.

10:41.373 --> 10:43.347
Hey, maybe you could
drive me around and help me out,

10:43.348 --> 10:45.500
and I could even pay you a
little something for your time.

10:45.501 --> 10:47.251
Sure, that sounds great.
And you know what?

10:47.252 --> 10:48.754
It'll be nice having
a little extra cash

10:48.755 --> 10:50.590
to bet on
college football.

10:50.591 --> 10:52.292
Yeah, I'd like to
bet a hundred bucks.

10:52.293 --> 10:53.628
You want to pick a team?

10:53.629 --> 10:55.498
No, just take it.

11:01.907 --> 11:03.541
I thought you had the day off.

11:03.542 --> 11:05.594
Maybe from the store,
but it's not like things

11:05.595 --> 11:08.448
take a day off from needing
repairs, am I right?

11:08.449 --> 11:11.185
Oh, looks like this cabinet door
is a good place to start.

11:11.186 --> 11:12.520
Yup, she's off-kilter.

11:12.521 --> 11:14.123
I'm gonna have
to plane her down.

11:14.124 --> 11:16.059
Lois, what year was
this house built?

11:16.060 --> 11:18.529
Uh, I don't know.
Maybe 1945?

11:18.530 --> 11:20.732
Good, it's grandfathered in.
Thought I'd need a variance.

11:20.733 --> 11:22.200
