get a code vi.

11:22.201 --> 11:24.070
"Vi" is violation.

11:24.071 --> 11:25.572
"Code" is just code.

11:25.573 --> 11:28.065
I don't know, Brian,
it looks straight to me.

11:28.066 --> 11:29.978
- What?
- It's straight.

11:29.979 --> 11:32.014
I-I don't know what that means.
"It's-it's straight"?

11:32.015 --> 11:33.383
Oh, you mean plumb.

11:33.384 --> 11:34.918
Y-You're saying
the door is plumb.

11:34.919 --> 11:37.655
Wow, Brian, you do know
all the lingo.

11:37.656 --> 11:40.426
Ah, come on, that's just
stuff you pick up on the site.

11:40.427 --> 11:42.662
I'm gonna go use a miter
to jerry-rig a shim jamb

11:42.663 --> 11:44.265
strap hinge
quarter-round soffit

11:44.266 --> 11:47.502
two-by-six dowel
cherry-picker flim-flam.

11:47.503 --> 11:49.505
You know, Rupert,
Brian's douche-iness

11:49.506 --> 11:52.543
should infuriate me,
but the truth is he seems happy.

11:52.544 --> 11:54.896
So I guess I'll just do nothing
and that's that.

11:59.888 --> 12:01.622
Can't do it.
Let's get him fired.

12:42.681 --> 12:46.185
Boy, I have a whole new respect
for Hayden Panettiere.

12:46.186 --> 12:48.239
Giggity.

12:48.240 --> 12:49.322
I'm pulling up. You ready?

12:49.323 --> 12:51.826
Oh, hey, Peter, listen, I can't
work tonight. I'm spent.

12:51.827 --> 12:53.194
That last trick was like

12:53.195 --> 12:55.097
