an empty bottle of hand soap.

12:55.098 --> 12:56.966
But you got to work.
I set up five appointments.

12:56.967 --> 12:59.103
That's a lot of money.
Sorry, I can't do it.

12:59.104 --> 13:00.337
You're just gonna
have to cancel them.

13:00.338 --> 13:02.374
What the hell
did you say to me?!

13:02.375 --> 13:03.509
Peter, what are
you doing?!

13:03.510 --> 13:04.977
You trippin', boy?!

13:04.978 --> 13:07.347
You're going out if I tell you
you're going out, bitch!

13:07.348 --> 13:08.683
