- No, I'm a pimp.

13:35.924 --> 13:37.859
Um, Big Pete, if we're
gonna be sitting,

13:37.860 --> 13:39.362
may I use my
penis donut?

13:39.363 --> 13:40.563
Bitch, I don't care.

13:40.564 --> 13:42.599
Dang, Quagmire,
you're lucky.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.935
He take care of you.

13:43.936 --> 13:45.270
Yeah, no, no,
it's great.

13:45.271 --> 13:46.739
Um, I'm making
a lot of money.

13:46.740 --> 13:47.873
I'm actually really happy.

13:47.874 --> 13:49.761
I'm actually very hungry.

13:49.762 --> 13:51.165
Nobody's gonna want
you if you're fat!

13:51.166 --> 13:51.946
You want to eat?

13:51.947 --> 13:53.816
