you, right?

14:04.766 --> 14:06.734
Hi, there.
You want to party?

14:06.735 --> 14:08.469
And can I have
some of your bread?

14:08.470 --> 14:09.571
Hi, handsome.

14:09.572 --> 14:11.574
You can't have my bread,
but you can have

14:11.575 --> 14:14.178
