14:37.010 --> 14:39.846
You, you and you,
20 bucks for the day.

14:39.847 --> 14:40.931
Hop in the back.

14:40.932 --> 14:42.216
No!

14:42.217 --> 14:44.053
Asiento trasero
Trasero!

14:44.054 --> 14:45.487
Forget it, just get in.

14:45.488 --> 14:47.824
Anyone who doesn't enjoy
the music of Josh Groban

14:47.825 --> 14:50.027
can get out of
the (BLEEP) car.

14:53.433 --> 14:56.202
Okay, if you had a friend
who worked at Mega Hardware,

14:56.203 --> 14:57.805
how would you
get him fired?

14:57.806 --> 14:59.507
You ask him for papers?

14:59.508 --> 15:00.809
Okay, good.

15:00.810 --> 15:02.812
Uh, that, unfortunately,
